{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# New'O'Nautics\n## Mod Map - Similar\n\n**Green arrow** = similar AND mergeable (we could share their recipes or data).\n\nOnly mods that have at least one arrow in this map are shown. `Mod Map.canvas` has every mod.\n\nColoured branches = category -> mod.\n\nEdges are suggestions; edit freely.\n\nSee [[Pack Scan - Compat Features]], [[Electricity Audit]].","x":-310,"y":-260,"width":620,"height":520},
		{"id":"hub_food","type":"text","text":"# Food & Drink","x":-356,"y":1932,"width":340,"height":120,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"fd","type":"text","text":"**Farmer's Delight**\nCooking pot, skillet, cutting board, stove, crops, baskets. The base most food mods build on.","x":256,"y":1900,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"kc","type":"text","text":"**Kaleidoscope Cookery**\nChinese-style cooking: wok, stockpot, steamer, millstone, stove. Has its own dish Quality (Superb→Poor) and Recipe records.","x":126,"y":1472,"width":300,"height":174},
		{"id":"kc_auto","type":"text","text":"**KC Automation**\nMechanical Arms can run a whole wok / stockpot / steamer / shawarma recipe.","x":-838,"y":1531,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"kc_tavern","type":"text","text":"**KC Tavern**\nWine barrels with 6 brew levels, pressing tub, cocktail shaker, bar furniture.","x":-520,"y":2279,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"kc_liquor","type":"text","text":"**KC World Liquor**\nSpirits, cocktails, ice cream, a freezer, bar stools.","x":-275,"y":2741,"width":300,"height":122},
		{"id":"cck","type":"text","text":"**Create: Central Kitchen**\nCreate automation for FD/KC: arms, deployers, funnels, packagers feed cooking blocks.","x":-925,"y":1909,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"hub_econ","type":"text","text":"# Economy & Trade","x":-900,"y":-609,"width":340,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"numis","type":"text","text":"**Create Numismatics**\nCoin currency, bank accounts and terminals, depositors, vendors (player shops).","x":-291,"y":-686,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"deliver","type":"text","text":"**Delivery Required**\nContractor delivery contracts, Market, P2P terminal; currency rewards; has a 'Crew Food Crate' contract.","x":-982,"y":-1046,"width":300,"height":174},
		{"id":"hub_decor","type":"text","text":"# Building, Decor & Dyes","x":601,"y":-216,"width":340,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dyedepot","type":"text","text":"**Dye Depot + Dye The World**\n16 new dyes and a huge range of dyed blocks, items and banners.","x":755,"y":127,"width":300,"height":122},
		{"id":"hub_create","type":"text","text":"# Create Core & Logistics","x":170,"y":576,"width":340,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"create","type":"text","text":"**Create 6.0**\nKinetic machines, fluids, trains, packages, vaults, and the mixing/pressing/crushing recipe types. The hub of the pack.","x":101,"y":947,"width":300,"height":174},
		{"id":"framed","type":"text","text":"**Create Framed**\nFramed / tiled glass in many colours, cardboard blocks, table cloths.","x":792,"y":500,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"hub_industry","type":"text","text":"# Industry, Energy & Fluids","x":777,"y":-1605,"width":340,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ca","type":"text","text":"**Crafts & Additions**\nKinetic ↔ FE: alternator, motor, wires, accumulator, tesla coil.","x":-78,"y":-1317,"width":300,"height":122},
		{"id":"pg","type":"text","text":"**Power Grid**\nSimulated electricity: transformers, FE inverter, solar tiles, punch cards.","x":247,"y":-1752,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"ee","type":"text","text":"**Electro Energetics**\nRealistic electricity: panels, breakers, resistors, converter to FE.","x":732,"y":-2204,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"tfmg","type":"text","text":"**The Factory Must Grow (TFMG)**\nSteel, oil refining, chemical vat, engines, own electricity. Two jars installed.","x":-228,"y":-2352,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"petrochem","type":"text","text":"**Petrochem**\nFull refinery chain: desalting, cracking, electrolyzer, turbine, kerosene, asphalt.","x":1044,"y":-1238,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"petrodep","type":"text","text":"**Petro Deposits**\nPetroleum deposits, scanner and gauge for Petrochem.","x":667,"y":-720,"width":300,"height":88},
		{"id":"cdg","type":"text","text":"**Diesel Generators**\nCrude oil, distillation, plant oil, biodiesel, diesel engines, concrete.","x":1927,"y":-1392,"width":300,"height":148},
		{"id":"liquidfuel","type":"text","text":"**Create Liquid Fuel**\nPipe liquid fuel into Blaze Burners.","x":1377,"y":-1755,"width":300,"height":122},
		{"id":"bnc","type":"text","text":"**Brewin' & Chewin'**\nFermenting Keg for drinks, cheese wheels, fondue, quiche.","x":642,"y":2645,"width":300,"height":96},
		{"id":"hub_guns","type":"text","text":"# Guns & Combat","color":"3","x":-481,"y":503,"width":340,"height":120},
		{"id":"irons","type":"text","text":"**Iron's Arms 'n Artifice**\nHistorical-fantasy firearms: flintlock, blunderbuss, modular parts and modifiers. Needs Iron's Lib; MT Artifice Hand Fix patches first-person hands.","x":-1064,"y":119,"width":300,"height":200},
		{"id":"tacz","type":"text","text":"**TACZ + GunsmithLib + TaCZ JS**\nTimeless & Classics Guns: Zero. Data-driven guns, Gun Smith Table, ammo boxes; KubeJS hooks; Pack Upgrader.","x":-478,"y":872,"width":300,"height":174},
		{"id":"cit","type":"text","text":"**Create Immersive TaCZ**\nCreate recipes for TACZ: gun barrels, trigger mechanisms, casings, primers. Already bridges TACZ and Create.","x":-1575,"y":-882,"width":300,"height":174},
		{"id":"cogs","type":"text","text":"**Cogs For Arms**\nAlready links Iron's Arms 'n Artifice to Create: cogs, stocks, barrels, cylinders, magazines via sequenced assembly, deploying, mixing.","x":-1305,"y":800,"width":300,"height":200}
